comment;#1: At most one citywide infrastructural project could be selected in a given district. Therefore O-4 and O-21 were not selected despite their ranking positions because higher-ranked projects had already been selected in Zemborzyce and Czuby Północne, respectively. #2: Only 425,498 PLN remained for O-67, so the city reduced the project's cost from 966,000 PLN to 425,498 PLN.
